      "writtenOn": "2025-11-07T18:39:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, re-entrancy is definitely deadlocking atm since `Unmap` and `Destroy` take the device lock, so I agree that this change is only possible after that problem is fixed.\n\nI also agree that it\u0027s hard to guarantee systematically, but I am hopeful that we can make it work eventually?",
